WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Ask a user manager to verify your phone number and unique last four digits.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 2: Check that the shift is assigned, published, at this location and on the correct Melbourne day.

3
